  "body": "when we set web_client_location it only impact the root access to matrix server but because we put it in the matrix configuration it means that this web_client_location weight more for us admins on our matrix selfhosted server than others and should be put on top of the list of the proposed clients.\r\n\r\ntheir also should be an option to disable that list and when someone enter a shared room through url he is forced to the web_client_location (something more acceptable for companies than giving the guest the choice to enter through app.element.io for example and fail because federation is disable for security concern).",
